  "scope": "Fixed-view seated Elder laugh-seated cycle and once-hold playback at the home camp only. No moving foot/cane, 360-degree pose transition, pickaxe work, or seamless change between different camp activities is approved.",
  "checks": {
    "identity-and-scale": "All eight exported poses and the live camp render inspected. Same bald Elder, broad white beard, embroidered olive-brown coat, belt and brown boots. Runtime uses the same740px standing-equivalent seated-body height across the camp activities; laughing head tilt is intentional, not a change in character scale.",
    "station-and-foot-contact": "Both visible boots and the stool retain their seated ground baseline through eight frames and7-to0. No translating root or walking stance. Small outline differences remain within the appearance of seated motion. This approval does not certify a moving anatomical sole.",
    "hand-and-tool-contact": "Right hand rests against his chest as the torso tilts backward; left hand rests on the knee. Neither hand releases an object and no tool contact is implied.",
    "prop-continuity": "Same stool, boots, clothing and pouches through every frame. No independently rendered station is superimposed at this camp activity. No carried prop in this cycle.",
    "last-to-first-transition": "Eight poses inspected in order, including0/7 comparison. Frame7 returns to the chest-hand seated laugh near0; the head tilt decreases from the central laugh apex without exchanging props. Live task stops on7 with one completion; the finite camp sequence holds that pose for two seconds before a distinct activity. Rechecked in the final live build with all eight frames observed; each preloaded activity handoff retains a displayed work pose, including while waiting for the next texture."
  },
